# Articles: prose and MDX-embedded JSX, where reflowing changes what gets published.
apps/website/src/content/**

# Generated or vendored. Directory patterns without a slash match at any workspace depth.
# These must be listed here even when a workspace's own .gitignore already covers them:
# prettier reads the ROOT .gitignore only, so a nested one (like the showcase's .astro/)
# leaves build output visible to the gate and makes it fail only after a build has run.
.next/
.turbo/
.astro/
storybook-static/
coverage/
dist/
ds-bundle/
.ds-sync/
playwright-report/
test-results/
public/
package-lock.json
CHANGELOG.md

# Agent tooling: vendored skills, this repo's agent memory and rules, and the prompts of the plugins' agents, skills
# and workflows. Not shipped code, and reflowing instruction markdown is churn with no reader.
.claude/
claude-plugins/*/agents/
claude-plugins/*/skills/
claude-plugins/*/workflows/

# Formatted by oxfmt, not prettier: its `lint` script runs `oxfmt --check`, so letting
